a customer has a name and a price.
to give a customer a discount of some percent:
    reduce the customer's price by the percent percent.
to introduce a customer to another customer:
    say the customer's name, the other customer's name.
give ann a discount of 10 percent.
give every loyal customer a discount of 5 percent.
introduce ann to bob.
increase price by 5 percent.
reduce price by 2.
